# Monorepo

- pnpm workspaces: `apps/*`, `packages/*`, `tools/*`. Isolated linker.
- Nx projects: `theme`, `base-components`, `workspace`, plus one project per app.
- Apps depend on `@medmate/theme` and `@medmate/base-components`.
- `base-components` depends only on `theme` and React Native peers.
- Packages do not import from `apps/`.
- Add apps only with `pnpm create-app`. Do not hand-copy an Expo project.
- Shared packages export TypeScript source. Do not add a `dist` build.
- Pin `expo`, `react`, and `react-native` through the pnpm catalog.
